From f02422d42492523c31c32bb7fda419bcaa0ff275 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dallas Delaney <dadelan@microsoft.com>
Date: Wed, 2 Sep 2026 19:16:57 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] erofs: gate signed capabilities on kernel support

Probe dm-verity, root-hash signature support, and usable thread keyrings before advertising signed referrer handling. Required modes fail during initialization while optional modes remain available as plain EROFS.

Co-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>

